{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Seven distinct solitaire systems</strong>\u200b</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This collection features seven solitaire games. Some are familiar, classic variants. Others twist solitaire into odd, alchemical systems with their own internal logic.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884930/extras/a5103f56d7811af01be23675da36a4f8.poster.avif?t=1770615439\" width=608 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884930/extras/a5103f56d7811af01be23675da36a4f8.webm?t=1770615439\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884930/extras/a5103f56d7811af01be23675da36a4f8.mp4?t=1770615439\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unforgiving challenges</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Card values rise or decay automatically as turns pass. Pressure escalate quickly and decision is irreversible. Plan ahead, master each system, or watch them collapse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884930/extras/31e43296a5b78b62d09afdd47e5717a0.poster.avif?t=1770615439\" width=608 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884930/extras/31e43296a5b78b62d09afdd47e5717a0.webm?t=1770615439\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884930/extras/31e43296a5b78b62d09afdd47e5717a0.mp4?t=1770615439\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Against Entropy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/388493